+/**
+ * The one grid card used by every Saved-mode list (library items, History entries, the Not watched
+ * yet shelf): the shared [GridContentCard] row idiom with this tree's navigation wiring.
+ * [caption], when set (History cards), fills the card's secondary label under the title.
